[0.000, "o", "\r\nWHAT THE DATA ACTUALLY CONTAINED\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  correct verdict: NAME THE CAUSE\r\n  planted cause: The onboarding modal shipped in deploy 91c3e4a regressed mobile conversion from 4.2% to 2.9%.\r\n  decoys placed to mislead: pricing page, campaign, seasonality\r\n  signals a correct answer names: any of [91c3e4a, 913], mobile\r\n"]
